{"id":"event_goddessfall2_02_e","cat":"event","group":{"id":"ev40094","label":"GODDESS FALL · Part 2"},"label":"A Nayuta Like No Other: B","stage":null,"prev":"event_goddessfall2_02_s","next":"event_goddessfall2_03_s","speakers":{"nayuta":"Nayuta","johan":"Johan","snowwhite":"Snow White","hongryeon":"Scarlet","isabel":"Isabel","harran":"Harran"},"icons":{"nayuta":"si_c223_00_s","johan":"si_c925_00_s","snowwhite":"si_c220_00_s","hongryeon":"si_c222_00_s","isabel":"si_c231_00_s","harran":"si_c230_00_s"},"lines":[{"id":"event_goddessfall2_02_e_1","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall2_02_e_1","text":"A monk dashes forward, staff gripped tightly in hand.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"Desert_02","bgArt":"desert_02","image":null,"bgm":"event_bgm_goddessfall_onloocker","movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall2_02_e_2","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall2_02_e_2","text":"Dodging the crimson light pouring from above and ahead, she swings her staff at the Rapture before her.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall2_02_e_3","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall2_02_e_3","text":"The Rapture's armor shatters, revealing the core beneath. Without pause, she drives the staff deep into it.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall2_02_e_4","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall2_02_e_4","text":"Even as another Rapture lunges from the side, her eyes snap toward it. The staff follows, arcing in a swift, practiced strike.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall2_02_e_5","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall2_02_e_5","text":"The crimson light engulfs her upper body, melting it away without a trace.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall2_02_e_6","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall2_02_e_6","text":"Blue flames bloom across what remains of her, leaving behind only a shimmer of golden particles.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"EventScene_goddessfall_15_1","bgArt":"eventscene_goddessfall_15_1","image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall2_02_e_7","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall2_02_e_7","text":"The golden particles scatter like dust in the wind, drifting far before entering the monk, who is seated calmly in meditation.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall2_02_e_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall2_02_e_8","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall2_02_e_9","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall2_02_e_9","text":"Memories begin to flow in.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall2_02_e_10","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall2_02_e_10","text":"That clone once had a herd of deer she cared for.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"EventScene_goddessfall_16_1","bgArt":"eventscene_goddessfall_16_1","image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall2_02_e_11","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall2_02_e_11","text":"She fed them, tended to the fawns, and protected them from predators.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall2_02_e_12","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall2_02_e_12","text":"One newborn fawn was in poor health, and she watched over it with utmost care.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall2_02_e_13","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall2_02_e_13","text":"The fawn clung to the clone as if she were its mother, and the doe regarded her as family.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall2_02_e_14","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall2_02_e_14","text":"The image of the fawn growing up, the longing for the herd, and the searing pain when the upper body melted away—all come through in full force.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall2_02_e_15","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall2_02_e_15","text":"Nayuta erases the memory, leaving only information about the terrain.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"EventScene_goddessfall_15_1","bgArt":"eventscene_goddessfall_15_1","image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall2_02_e_16","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall2_02_e_16","text":"Like a raging warlord, another monk tears through the horde of Rapture.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall2_02_e_17","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall2_02_e_17","text":"Along the path forward, twenty had already fallen, crushed beneath unstoppable might.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall2_02_e_18","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall2_02_e_18","text":"Though she lost an arm to the crimson light blazing ahead, she presses on without pause.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall2_02_e_19","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall2_02_e_19","text":"Narrowly dodging the fiery beams raining down from above, she loses her footing and collapses.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall2_02_e_20","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall2_02_e_20","text":"A Rapture's leg slams down, crushing her.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall2_02_e_21","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall2_02_e_21","text":"Blue flames bloom across what remains of her, leaving behind only a shimmer of golden particles.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall2_02_e_22","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall2_02_e_22","text":"The golden particles scatter like dust in the wind, drifting far before entering the monk, who is seated calmly in meditation.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall2_02_e_23","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall2_02_e_23","text":"Memories begin to flow in.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall2_02_e_24","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall2_02_e_24","text":"That clone had once met a lost Nikke by chance and taken on the role of guiding her north.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"EventScene_goddessfall_16_2","bgArt":"eventscene_goddessfall_16_2","image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall2_02_e_25","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall2_02_e_25","text":"A sudden ambush by a swarm of Raptures claimed the Nikke's life, and the clone could only curse at her own powerlessness.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall2_02_e_26","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall2_02_e_26","text":"She pushed herself through endless training, determined to prevent it from ever happening again.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall2_02_e_27","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall2_02_e_27","text":"Nayuta erases the memory, leaving only information about the martial techniques.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall2_02_e_28","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall2_02_e_28","text":"A memory of a clone who broke down in tears before the grave of someone whose name she never knew.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"EventScene_goddessfall_16_3","bgArt":"eventscene_goddessfall_16_3","image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall2_02_e_29","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall2_02_e_29","text":"A memory of a clone who lived her entire life consumed by hatred, killing Raptures and nothing more.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"EventScene_goddessfall_16_4","bgArt":"eventscene_goddessfall_16_4","image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall2_02_e_30","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall2_02_e_30","text":"A memory of a clone who befriended a scarecrow in a wheat field and promised she would return.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"EventScene_goddessfall_16_5","bgArt":"eventscene_goddessfall_16_5","image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall2_02_e_31","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall2_02_e_31","text":"A memory of a clone who built a house by the sea and spent her days staring endlessly at the waves.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"EventScene_goddessfall_16_6","bgArt":"eventscene_goddessfall_16_6","image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall2_02_e_32","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall2_02_e_32","text":"All these memories flow into Nayuta,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"EventScene_goddessfall_15_1","bgArt":"eventscene_goddessfall_15_1","image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall2_02_e_33","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall2_02_e_33","text":"but she erases all the personal memories of each clone.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall2_02_e_34","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall2_02_e_34","text":"Tears fall.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"EventScene_goddessfall_15_2","bgArt":"eventscene_goddessfall_15_2","image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall2_02_e_35","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall2_02_e_35","text":"She mourns the traces left by those countless clones.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall2_02_e_36","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall2_02_e_36","text":"She grieves, knowing she is too small a vessel to hold all their memories. So she laments and erases them.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall2_02_e_37","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall2_02_e_37","text":"And as the tears fall, she watches helplessly","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall2_02_e_38","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall2_02_e_38","text":"as countless clones—each living their own life, yet so like herself—vanish into red light.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall2_02_e_39","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall2_02_e_39","text":"And all the while, they charge toward the horde of Raptures.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall2_02_e_40","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall2_02_e_40","text":"20 minutes ago.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"BrokenEdenLobby","bgArt":"brokenedenlobby","image":null,"bgm":"event_bgm_goddessfall_lastflight","movie":null,"shown":["nayuta","johan","snowwhite","hongryeon","isabel","harran"],"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall2_02_e_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall2_02_e_41","text":"I shall dispatch all my replicas in unison to charge, that they may at once contend with the Raptures,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall2_02_e_42","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall2_02_e_42","text":"and serve as bulwarks against the Queen's interception arms.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall2_02_e_43","type":"Speech","speaker":"johan","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall2_02_e_43","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall2_02_e_44","type":"Speech","speaker":"snowwhite","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall2_02_e_44","text":"What do you mean by a shield?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall2_02_